  "stem": "The function \\(f\\) is defined by \\(f(x) = 3(2)^{x} - 10\\). What is the value of \\(f(3)\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "14"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Substitute \\(3\\) for \\(x\\): \\(f(3) = 3(2)^{3} - 10\\).",
    "\\(2^{3} = 8\\), so \\(f(3) = 3(8) - 10 = 24 - 10 = 14\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
  "traps": null,
